WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:11.428
♪♪

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:13.305
It's mommy's first day back
to the office this week.

00:00:13.305 --> 00:00:14.431
I don't want you to go,

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:15.140
don't go.

00:00:15.641 --> 00:00:17.935
♪♪

00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:19.645
♪ They're not brave like you ♪

00:00:19.645 --> 00:00:21.438
♪ They're too scared to do ♪

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:23.315
♪ Anything that's different ♪

00:00:23.315 --> 00:00:24.483
♪ Anything that's new ♪

00:00:25.651 --> 00:00:26.318
Ta-da

00:00:26.318 --> 00:00:27.236
Wow

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:29.404
Uh, is it for your
golf trophies?

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:30.239
It's for you.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:34.451
They're turning your
book into a movie.

00:00:34.952 --> 00:00:36.578
I wish I felt less
itchy about it.

00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:37.955
Mhm-mhm, make the most of this.

00:00:37.955 --> 00:00:39.122
I don't understand why you guys 

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:40.791
aren't answering any
of my questions.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:42.876
You're not saying anything.

00:00:46.255 --> 00:00:47.547
There's a lot of
photos missing.

00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:48.590
I ate them.

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:49.424
What?

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:53.345
I got married without
even knowing

00:00:53.345 --> 00:00:54.471
what he would be like.

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:56.348
You could return him.

00:00:57.057 --> 00:00:58.934
And what's the reason for
returning your husband?

00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:00.060
Where to start?

00:01:01.353 --> 00:01:03.730
♪ Gather 'round, here's how to
get what you want ♪

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:07.401
♪ Introduce a new religion
of feeling like a boss ♪

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:11.071
Oh my God

00:01:11.697 --> 00:01:12.698
Who would do this?

00:01:12.948 --> 00:01:13.949
I'm a ghost.

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:17.369
It's annoying that you're
actually kind of attractive.

00:01:19.371 --> 00:01:20.580
You want to take
revenge like a man?

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.581
You gotta dress like one.

00:01:22.457 --> 00:01:24.001
Or not take revenge,

00:01:24.001 --> 00:01:25.085
is the other option.

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:27.796
I met someone.

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:29.381
Oh my God, is he married?

00:01:29.381 --> 00:01:30.215
No

00:01:30.257 --> 00:01:31.258
Do you want dessert?

00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:35.095
I will do bedtime.

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:36.305
That's a risky move,

00:01:36.305 --> 00:01:37.139
promising bedtime.

00:01:38.557 --> 00:01:39.975
[screams]

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:45.105
♪♪

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:48.025
I really don't know how
you ladies do it.

00:01:48.233 --> 00:01:50.027
Mhm, witchcraft mainly.

00:01:53.697 --> 00:01:55.115
If I am a ghost...

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:57.617
Why am I still getting cramps?

